    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10796" root="خصل" body-key="x">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَصَلَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَصْلٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He cut,</i> or
<i>cut off,</i> a thing; (K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَلَ</span>. (TA.)
[Accord. to the TA, this is the proper, or primary signification.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَصَلَهُمْ</span>, [aor., accord. to
rule, 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَصُلَ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَصْلٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِصَالٌ</span>, <i>He overcame
them,</i> or <i>surpassed them, in shooting.</i> (S, K. [In
the CK, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَضَلَهُمْ</span> is erroneously put for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَضلَهُمْ</span>.])
See also 3.

